 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "DomainRateLimiter(maxRequests, windowSize) starts with no history. Requests arrive one per second: the i-th call of allowRequest(domain) (i = 1, 2, ...) happens at second i. allowRequest(domain) returns true and records the request when that domain has fewer than maxRequests accepted requests at seconds s with s > i - windowSize; otherwise it returns false and records nothing (rejected requests never count).",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
